# MSIX / packaging artifacts
#
# Both spellings: the .appx* names are the older ones, and the packaging targets have emitted
# .msix* since the format was renamed — which is what scripts/package-store.ps1 produces. Only the
# .appx* half was listed here, so a several-hundred-megabyte submission package was one `git add .`
# away from the history.
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
artifacts/
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.appxsym
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.msixupload
*.msixsym
*.pfx
*.cer
*.snk

